      "statement": "build-release bundles every deployable worker byte-identically to wrangler deploy (dry-run + outdir with the pinned wrangler), builds the Access-mode frontend assets, and generates the release manifest; output is manifest.json plus content-addressed modules/<sha256> and assets/<cfHash> blobs, with the manifest uploaded last because its presence marks the release complete.",
