      "statement": "The manifest generator reads every package with a wrangler.jsonc (sorted) and fails closed on any config key outside HANDLED_CONFIG_KEYS — a new key on a deployable worker needs an explicit decision about how customer instances get it; account-specific values become placeholders like $ACCOUNT_ID, $WORKER_NAME(...), $SECRET(...), and $PUBLIC_BASE_URL.",
