      "statement": "The manifest contract deliberately carries only $PUBLIC_BASE_URL for the backend (instance-state vars like ADMINS, DEPLOY_URL, CF_ACCESS_*, CF_AI_GATEWAY_* are injected by the deploy service at PUT time, never manifest-templated), hardcodes the Workers AI binding for every backend (webFetch's toMarkdown depends on it; cross-account gateways opt out with CF_AI_GATEWAY_USE_BINDING=false), and expands installed gatekeepers as GATEKEEPER_* service bindings to the GatekeeperVendor entrypoint with gatekeeper-context receiving sharingDomain $PUBLIC_BASE_URL in its props.",
