      "id": "claim_843273d305e141f1954ea3ee1a0b33e0",
      "statement": "upload-release mirrors a built release to R2 via the S3 API: content-addressed blobs are HEAD'd and skipped when present, the manifest is uploaded LAST so a crashed upload never leaves a manifest pointing at missing blobs, and --candidate puts the manifest under candidates/<id>/ invisible to the deploy service (which scans only releases/).",
